<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n71482" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ξενᾱγ-έω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>to be a leader of mercenaries,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ξ. ξενικοῦ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>HG</u>
					4.3.15
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				4.3.17
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.
				23.139
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arr.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				99J.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>guide strangers, show them the sights,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄριστά σοι ἐξενάγηται</span> your
				<i>work as a guide has been done</i> excellently, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Phdr.</u>
				230c
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ξεναγούμενος</span>
			<i>one seeing the sights,</i> ibid. ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ξενάγησόν με νέηλυν ὄντα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>DMort.</u>
					18.1
				</span></i>
			, cf. <u>Cont.</u>I : metaph., generally, <i>guide,
				direct,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Alciphr.
				1.26
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ξ. τινὰ πρὸς τὰς Μούσας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Them.
					<u>Or.</u>
					9.123b
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				2.330
			</span></i> :—
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπὸ σοφίας ξ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					1.630
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			
				Med.
			, <i>receive hospitality,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Procop.
				<u>Goth.</u>
				3.9
			</span></i> :—so in 
				Pass.
			, ib.<i><span class="en">
				4.22
			</span></i>.</div>
